OL,3,GNEWSA'Sick and abusive' rapist jailed
OL,4,Afor 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "sick and abusive man" who repeatedly
OL,7,Fraped a woman and threatened to kill
OL,8,Fher family when she told police has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for 20 years.
OL,11,FFarman Ali, 28, sexually and mentally
OL,12,Fabused his victim over six months
OL,13,Fbetween 2024 and 2025 with the help of
OL,14,Ftwo women - Zarina Zarina and Saadia
OL,15,FMohammad.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said the victim
OL,18,Freported the abuse in January 2025 but
OL,19,FAli tried to intimidate her in a bid to
OL,20,Fmake her retract the allegations.
