OL,3,GNEWSA'Sick and abusive' rapist jailed
OL,4,Afor 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAli, of The Oval, in Firth Park, was
OL,7,Ffound guilty after a trial of 11
OL,8,Fcharges, including six counts of rape,
OL,9,Fand was jailed for 20 years. Zarina and
OL,10,FMohammad were each jailed for three
OL,11,Fyears two months for their part in the
OL,12,Foffending.
